                            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Per layer outline (the last repeats): set it to one level, the Layer Percentile of the ground under it (water). An outline whose ground falls more than 2 m across it (a river mapped as an area) follows the ground instead. LiDAR Site's Flatten output.</item>
                            <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">e26ae898-04b1-495e-85e0-dddec18a7109</item>
