                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Share Pack</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Write results as files anyone can open without Rhino: ONE self-contained HTML viewer (top-down map with pan/zoom and an orbiting 3D view, sets and layers, legend, hover readout, KPI tables, wind rose, swipe and difference comparison between sets, print to PDF — works offline from the file), glTF binaries (.glb, one per layer, for web/VR/AR viewers), float32 GeoTIFFs (UTM when the site latitude/longitude is given), a PDF report and slide-ready PNGs. Wire one Values branch per layer over the Points (or a Mesh with per-vertex or per-face values). Every file states that the results were computed by the solver and that Eddy3D is the front end.

Version 1.22.0.827

Version 1.22.0.827</item>
